{"type":"npc","name":"Gargantoad","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":470,"temp":0,"max":470,"details":""},"ac":{"value":42,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":60,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"climb","value":60},{"type":"swim","value":90}],"details":"hopper"}},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":[],"details":""},"level":{"value":20},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>When the bellowing croak of a gargantoad echoes across the landscape, those unfortunate souls who hear it can only hope that the gargantoad has different prey in mind. Gargantoads are house-sized carnivorous amphibians that hop and slither forward with uncanny speed, grabbing lone prey with their sticky tongues or gathering herds in their tentacles to crush for later consumption.</p><h2>Uncanny Anatomy</h2><p>Gargantoads share some physical features with toads, frogs, and squid. They have warty skin, musculature, sticky tongues, and a camouflage coloration typically associated with toads, combined with a frog's long and powerful legs and webbed feet. Over a dozen retractable tentacles emerge from their bodies, assisting with gathering prey and supplementing the strength of their back legs to make incredible hops.</p><p>How did these creatures first come about? Legends of their existence stretch back to the earliest days of civilization, with some speculating that they are the offspring of an amphibious god, god-beasts from another realm, or the result of hybridization between primordial krakens and other beings.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 8,750/17,500/30,000 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning), armor (light), perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Athletics, Intimidation, Stealth, Survival)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> acid, body, bane, constitution, elongating, energy resistant (vitality), poison, poisonous armor, sensory (darkvision), strength, water, wild</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Benjamin Baugh","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":10},"dex":{"mod":6},"con":{"mod":9},"int":{"mod":-3},"wis":{"mod":5},"cha":{"mod":4}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":34,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":36,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":33,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":30,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":34},"athletics":{"base":40},"intimidation":{"base":36},"stealth":{"base":38},"survival":{"base":35}},"traits":{"value":["amphibious","beast"],"rarity":"rare","size":{"value":"grg"}}},"_id":"NER1xO7JnPOjIqJ1","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/gargantoad.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Gargantoad","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":4,"height":4,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/gargantoad.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":[],"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/subjects/gargantoad.webp"}},"flags":{"sf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"randomImg":false,"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"items":[{"type":"action","name":"Unfathomable Leap","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The gargantoad's mighty leg muscles propel it forward with reality-warping force. It Leaps up to 1,000 feet horizontally and 500 feet vertically. It can choose to carry any number of creatures that it has @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} or @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained} along with it.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["move"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"F2S4YPGQTNTeLXg0","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Terrifying Croak","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The gargantoad lets out a deep, resonant bellow that inflicts primal fear in all who hear it. All creatures within 1 mile must attempt a @Check[will|dc:44] save, with the following effects. Creatures that succeed at the save are temporarily immune to Terrifying Croak for 24 hours.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is frightened 2. For the next hour, any time that its turn begins and it is able to see, hear, or otherwise perceive the gargantoad, it must attempt another Will save against Terrifying Croak.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, except the creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 4}.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","emotion","fear","mental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"CxvceiFPsqVAG5L8","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Tentacle Forest","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The gargantoad attempts an Athletics check to [[/act grapple]] all creatures within reach of its tentacles. If any creatures were already @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} or @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained} in its tentacles, the gargantoad extends the duration of that condition until the end of its next turn.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["attack"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"34FGnmR0nldy8VLd","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Swallow Whole","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>Huge, @Damage[3d8[acid],3d10[bludgeoning]], Rupture 50.</p><p>Creatures that begin their turn Swallowed Whole are exposed to numbing toxin.</p><hr /><p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.SwallowWhole]</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":["attack"],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"swallow-whole","_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"deathNote":false},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.uJSseLa57HZYSMUu","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"2G2086qsGIaiAhfH"},{"type":"action","name":"Numbing Toxin","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:42]</p><p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p><p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[6d6[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} (1 round)</p><p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Damage[8d6[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 2} (1 round)</p><p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @Damage[10d6[poison]] damage and slowed 2 (1 round)</p><p><strong>Stage 4</strong> @Damage[12d6[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed} (1 round)</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["incapacitation","poison"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"prev